      "hub_id": 9119,
      "version": "0.7.0",
      "description": "<p>Support for 3.8.0</p>\n<p>Previous versions should work as well for 3.8.0, this version adds the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix armor images</li>\n<li>Save settings on your local disk</li>\n<li>New help menu\n<ul>\n<li>telemetry added, you can disable if you want, see <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/angel-git/tarkov-stash?tab=readme-ov-file#telemetry\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">readme</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Known issues:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Armor might not show correct durability</li>\n<li>Armor plates images might be missing</li>\n<li>Attachment images might be missing</li>\n</ul>\n<p>I haven’t got much time to test this version, let me know in the comments if you face any</p>\n",
